ind":"update","title":"Demo 0.9d Patch Notes","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo! The game has been updated to version 0.9d:The maximum turning sensitivity can now be set to 2.0.Fixed a bug that caused accuracy to drop to zero after the boss died.Fixed a bug that allowed the player to pass through diagonal walls when dashing into them.Redrew some art assets to make the overall visual style more consistent. Enjoy the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:31:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036638","verified_at":"2026-10-23T16:43:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5220440-1846651706695476","game_id":"steam-5220440","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.9c Patch Notes","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo! The demo has been updated to version 0.9c:The crosshair now indicates the cooldown status of the Dash ability.Keys are now more visible and float at a higher position.Slightly increased the aggression of melee enemies.Optimized object rendering order to improve frame rates. Enjoy the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:17:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695476","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5220440-1846651706683572","game_id":"steam-5220440","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.9a アップデート内容","summary":"Demo 0.9a アップデート内容：デモでプレイできるステージが5つに増え、第1章のボス戦も体験できるようになりました。主人公にダッシュ能力を追加しました。ステージクリア時の命中率実績の条件を50%から30%に引き下げました。敵AIを調整しました。敵は積極的にプレイヤーの背後に回り込まず、遠距離から横移動して弾丸を回避するようになりました。弾薬の補給量を調整し、プレイヤーが十分な弾薬を維持できることを重視しました。コントローラー使用時の敵の戦闘戦略を最適化しました。迷いにくくなるよう、マップ内の視覚的な案内を改善しました。","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:34:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683572","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5220440-1846018067926690","game_id":"steam-5220440","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.5 Update","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the Demo!Based on your feedback, the game has now been updated to version 0.5:Improved the visual effects and reduced visual distractions caused by complex filters.Fixed a bug where enemies could become embedded in walls in the third level.Fixed an error in the shotgun accuracy statistics.Enjoy the game!We hope you'll add the game to your Steam Wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:06:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926690","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5220440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5220440":"2026-10-26T09:29:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5220440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:57Z"},"5274090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:58Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5220440","app_id":5220440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:41Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha25